Yes. I searched the current ecosystem, including GBrain, Letta, Agent Skills, gstack, Superpowers, Agent Zero, OpenHands, Memento-Skills, SkillWeaver, Voyager, Agent Workflow Memory, skills.sh, and related systems.

The conclusion is fairly sharp:

> **The individual components of Moltwork WorkerKit now exist. The complete “agent develops a career through paid work” system does not appear to exist.**

Your existing WorkerKit concept already identifies the missing layer correctly: persistent work history, WorkRuns, capability acquisition, professional workflow, outcome learning, and eventually commercializing accumulated capability. 

