# 5. Superpowers gives us the generic professional loop

Superpowers is probably the best existing template for one particular part of WorkerKit.

Its workflow is essentially:

```text
understand
→ brainstorm
→ plan
→ isolate environment
→ execute
→ test
→ review
→ verify
→ finish
```

It treats these as mandatory process skills rather than optional prompts. ([GitHub][10])

That is precisely how I would define **Moltwork Core**.

Not:

> You are a useful worker. Work carefully.

But explicit skills which govern stages of professional work.

