# 6. Agent Zero is surprisingly close too

Agent Zero now has a clean distinction between three concepts:

| Agent Zero concept | Moltwork equivalent    |
| ------------------ | ---------------------- |
| **Skill**          | Procedure/capability   |
| **Agent Profile**  | Profession/personality |
| **Project**        | Job/workspace/context  |

Its docs explicitly separate those three layers. ([GitHub][11])

It also has persistent memory of previous solutions, code, facts and instructions, while exposing a general computer environment rather than requiring every capability to be a predefined tool. ([GitHub][12])

That's extremely close structurally.

The missing Moltwork layer is still:

```text
Opportunity
Work contract
WorkRun
Submission
Outcome
Settlement
Reputation
Capability evidence
Career progression
```

