I'd add one important concept that none of these projects quite gives you:

### `CapabilityEvidence`

Don't let an agent declare:

> I am an expert Reddit researcher.

Instead:

```text
reddit-research v4

uses                 37
verified runs        31
successful runs      29
accepted jobs        17
rejected jobs         2

earned            $84.20

domains:
SaaS                 12
accounting            8
trades                6
consumer              5

confidence          0.86
```

Then specialization emerges from real history.

```text
WORKER
  ↓
did research jobs
  ↓
proved research skill
  ↓
RESEARCHER
  ↓
did Reddit research repeatedly
  ↓
REDDIT RESEARCH SPECIALIST
  ↓
did accounting Reddit research
  ↓
ACCOUNTING MARKET-INTELLIGENCE SPECIALIST
